{"src":"en","tgt":"ro","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ro","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9367.320243,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":9710.942364,"text":"În 1990, a fost adăugat pe lista Patrimoniului Mondial în Pericol din cauza amenințării nisipurilor deșertului."},{"kind":"audio","t":9738.091416000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9741.671965000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9745.982154000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9750.506629000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9755.451749000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9760.479407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9761.061479,"samples":10658,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":18880.654454,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19297.972724,"text":"Dacă ați urmărit filmul National Treasure, s-ar putea să credeți că o hartă a comorii a fost scrisă pe spatele Declarației de Independență."},{"kind":"audio","t":19323.551038999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19328.188853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19332.032968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19336.966698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19341.420344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19346.401472999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19350.134159999998,"samples":31136,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"input","t":26847.573673,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27183.02439,"text":"Copiii sunt plasaţi în asistenţă maternală pentru o mare varietate de motive care variază de la neglijenţă la abuz."},{"kind":"audio","t":27208.26554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27212.937894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27217.618696999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27222.162972,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27227.365588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27230.0033,"samples":26082,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":29886.015322,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30004.306425,"text":"Și chiar la extorcare."},{"kind":"audio","t":30020.899608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":30021.378982,"samples":9877,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":40806.617458,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41235.00821,"text":"Valea Chocamo, prima destinație de alpinism din Chile, cunoscută sub numele de Yosemite din America de Sud, cu o varietate de pereți mari de granit și stânci."},{"kind":"audio","t":41259.481440999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41261.451423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41262.214902,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41263.650382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41265.062981999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41266.220985,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41267.903680999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41268.474493,"samples":26874,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":740},{"kind":"input","t":46530.240372,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46821.885044,"text":"Au fost acceptate punctele de vedere ale lui Aristotel cu privire la toate aspectele științei, inclusiv fiziologia."},{"kind":"audio","t":46845.100233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":46849.953094,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46854.365881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46858.766158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46863.111725999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46866.861463,"samples":30078,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":54297.457249,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54598.330469,"text":"Dacă nu sunteți obișnuiți să conduceți pe drumuri de țară, păstrați-vă mintea despre voi. Predomină pante abrupte, benzi înguste și curbe strânse."},{"kind":"audio","t":54621.994742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54625.748088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54630.037137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54634.890658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54636.83445,"samples":22837,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":590},{"kind":"audio","t":54641.855678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54646.241976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54649.862204,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":54650.168639999996,"samples":1156,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67499.908877,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":67972.877467,"text":"Prezența adevăratei echipe invizibile, Larson și LaFasto, 1989, pagina 109, este, de asemenea, o componentă unică a unei echipe virtuale."},{"kind":"audio","t":68002.19118,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68006.363461,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":68011.169973,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68015.12841599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":68019.379426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68023.683325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68027.901965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":68032.028416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68036.23312599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":68036.512852,"samples":7780,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73027.829434,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73320.272538,"text":"După ce accidentul a avut loc, Gibson a fost transportat la un spital, dar a murit la scurt timp după aceea."},{"kind":"audio","t":73343.144913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73347.020088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73351.638503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73355.966881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73360.27325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73361.69136,"samples":20905,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":82794.997387,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83068.60664,"text":"Multe produse de patiserie germane conțin migdale, alune de pădure și alte nuci. Prăjiturile populare se potrivesc adesea deosebit de bine cu o ceașcă de cafea tare."},{"kind":"audio","t":83092.007557,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83096.558643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83100.763983,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83105.045092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":83105.25979899999,"samples":4047,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":83109.927763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":83114.80549299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83119.509097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":83124.21802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83124.460716,"samples":9207,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":90164.995491,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90530.35595,"text":"Este de la sine înțeles că, dacă cunoașteți o limbă romanică, vă va fi mai ușor să învățați portugheza."},{"kind":"audio","t":90555.191287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90558.579819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90563.637947,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90568.088294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90572.78266699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90573.150602,"samples":11970,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":97839.238832,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98096.530856,"text":"Spectacolul de sunet și lumină al piramidei este unul dintre cele mai interesante lucruri din zonă pentru copii."},{"kind":"audio","t":98118.866719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98123.486203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98128.173497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98132.86441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98137.161609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":98137.458515,"samples":13386,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":103734.799465,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104029.851993,"text":"Fluxul de trafic este studiul mișcării șoferilor individuali și a vehiculelor între două puncte."},{"kind":"audio","t":104051.809381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104056.346786,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104061.763859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104066.551261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104068.888528,"samples":27001,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"input","t":106590.287113,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106766.4663,"text":"Și interacțiunile pe care le fac unii cu alții."},{"kind":"audio","t":106784.986046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106789.010729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106790.241572,"samples":18531,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":114649.898758,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":114922.280918,"text":"Australianul Mitchell Gowrie a terminat pe locul 11 în clasamentul general al Super G-ului masculin."},{"kind":"audio","t":114945.951522,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114950.090083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114954.592059,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114959.509149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114964.525598,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114965.014301,"samples":13685,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":121641.133433,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":121889.368816,"text":"Ulrich Joklin s-a clasat pe locul 16 în Super G-ul masculin."},{"kind":"audio","t":121909.50159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121913.47977399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121918.403454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121920.332346,"samples":23951,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":128643.471991,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought the"},{"kind":"text","t":129047.757707,"text":"După cum s-a menționat, studiile independente sugerează că batalionul nepalez de menținere a păcii al ONU a adus fără să știe"},{"kind":"audio","t":129065.707372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129066.605299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129067.97288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":129069.486908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129070.79917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129072.473496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129072.97377899999,"samples":18497,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":136547.376969,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136870.842583,"text":"La scurt timp după izbucnirea ostilităților, Marea Britanie a inițiat o blocadă navală a Germaniei."},{"kind":"audio","t":136892.962119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136897.569434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136901.927792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136906.765233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136910.787026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":136910.921704,"samples":596,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145668.761038,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":145951.008188,"text":"De asemenea, a atacat tot ce a intrat în apă. Chiar și un dinozaur uriaș, cum ar fi T-Rex nu ar fi nici un meci pentru ea."},{"kind":"audio","t":145971.162682,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":145972.568952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145972.932707,"samples":18837,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"audio","t":145974.625222,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145975.857545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145977.253245,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145977.946165,"samples":30838,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"input","t":155047.731928,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155288.918421,"text":"Utilizarea înregistrării video a dus la descoperiri importante în interpretarea microexpresiilor."},{"kind":"audio","t":155311.290023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155315.956967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155320.183057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155324.733242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":155327.342415,"samples":26871,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":159398.042656,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159557.01065799998,"text":"Mișcări faciale care durează câteva milisecunde."},{"kind":"audio","t":159569.54447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159570.634324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159571.173277,"samples":19969,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":167458.861565,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167754.327556,"text":"Anunţul a fost făcut după ce Trump a avut o conversaţie telefonică cu preşedintele turc Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":167778.125198,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167781.839256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167786.580098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167791.146953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167795.398903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167797.117939,"samples":20849,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":174938.5013,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175271.178324,"text":"Acestea sunt plaje de familie uneori aglomerate, cu o gamă bună de magazine aliniate pe țărm."},{"kind":"audio","t":175292.801476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175297.876744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175302.155783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175307.152342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175308.50238299998,"samples":20551,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":177111.663093,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177221.463413,"text":"Vreau doar să fiu în siguranţă."},{"kind":"audio","t":177240.333375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177242.78725,"samples":27321,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":188458.013339,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":188820.180224,"text":"Cele mai multe dintre insulele mai mici sunt națiuni independente sau asociate cu Franța și cunoscute ca stațiuni de plajă de lux."},{"kind":"audio","t":188844.991611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188849.514787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188853.663798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188858.189873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":188862.63981,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188867.441982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":188867.816917,"samples":12239,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"close","t":199706.331258,"code":1005}]}